# Fit Engine

## Purpose

Determine whether a bicycle can reproduce a rider's position.

The engine should prioritise contact points over frame geometry.

---

## Inputs

Rider

Bike

Cockpit

---

## Outputs

Predicted Handlebar X

Predicted Handlebar Y

Stem Recommendation

Spacer Recommendation

Fit Confidence

Recommendation

---

## Calculation Order

1. Frame geometry
2. Cockpit geometry
3. Predicted contact points
4. Compare to rider
5. Fit Confidence
6. Recommendation

---

Frame geometry alone should never determine the recommendation.FIT_ENGINE
